[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124681233","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3124681233","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3124681233,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66PtoR","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-27T19:32:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T05:34:19Z","body":"Think again, it makes sense to not create srgb texture automatically, because them may be not supported widely. Users should use `*_SRGB` format to make the texture work both in 2D and 3D.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3124681233/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3125651660","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3125651660","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3125651660,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66TajM","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T05:57:07Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T05:57:07Z","body":"OK, we can still create the srgb view by checking if the format is supported.\r\nI agree this would make texture rd work out of the box in 2D and 3D, rather than requiring users to understand the internal details of the engine.\r\nWithout this PR, using SRGB format is required and the corresponding glsl shader has to use SRGB textures as uniforms (or alternatively, convert them to linear manually in glsl) to match the linear color space.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3125651660/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3129910324","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3129910324","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3129910324,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66jqQ0","user":{"login":"DDarby-Lewis","id":37579938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc5OTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37579938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis","html_url":"https://github.com/DDarby-Lewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T21:15:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T21:15:18Z","body":"I am currently testing some of the points we discussed - I am curious over your choice here to add the `ensure_sharable_format` and use that to force the rd texture to use the rd view for srgb if it has a srgb_format.\r\nIn this [PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103836#issuecomment-3124717151) I have a change aimed at the same issue but with a different assumption to only make a srgb view if the user has added the shared formats.\r\n\r\nI think your change is more inline with the way standard textures work, but mine would potentially be less disruptive if users are depending on the data in their 8 bit RD textures not being converted to linear (i.e. they already have the data in linear).\r\n\r\nI will pull your changes here and test them also and test them also and comment what I find.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3129910324/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3129932097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3129932097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3129932097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66jvlB","user":{"login":"DDarby-Lewis","id":37579938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc5OTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37579938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis","html_url":"https://github.com/DDarby-Lewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T21:26:03Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T21:26:03Z","body":"I'm not really seeing where in the demo project you have this change tested. Could you share some screenshots that show a before and after this PR of 2d and 3d views for rd_texure with the 8bit format?\r\nI'm going to try and see that myself by pulling this change - but TBH not sure when I'll get to that. \r\nMy change to accomplish this required a good few more lines, so I have likely make changes that aren't strictly required!\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3129932097/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3130244482","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3130244482","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3130244482,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66k72C","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T01:05:30Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T12:09:51Z","body":">I'm not really seeing where in the demo project you have this change tested\r\n\r\nSorry it's not a clean test project. There are `main.tscn` and `3d.tscn` in it.\r\n\r\nEdit: I have updated the test project.\r\n\r\n>I am currently testing some of the points we discussed - I am curious over your choice here to add the ensure_sharable_format and use that to force the rd texture to use the rd view for srgb if it has a srgb_format.\r\n\r\nRequiring users to add the shareable formats may be confusing, the formats are determined by the engine.\r\n\r\n>In this https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103836#issuecomment-3124717151 I have a change aimed at the same issue but with a different assumption to only make a srgb view if the user has added the shared formats.\r\n\r\nIt forces to create a srgb view when available, but you can still use a non-srgb view in 3D by not to use `source_color` hint. Using the wrong `rd_texture_srgb` should not be the expected behavior.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3130244482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141285336","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3141285336","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3141285336,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67PDXY","user":{"login":"DDarby-Lewis","id":37579938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc5OTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37579938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis","html_url":"https://github.com/DDarby-Lewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T20:44:34Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T20:44:34Z","body":"I have tested this and found it isn't sufficient to adjust the way the engine handles auto converting the texture:\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"2064\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84fe63cd-a0d5-4ea1-b7f9-0276566c463d\" />\r\n\r\nI will make a change in my PR that shows an update. I think perhaps all it is missing is assigingin the view post the adjustment to the SRGB - but I will test it and see.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141285336/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141503317","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3141503317","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3141503317,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67P4lV","user":{"login":"DDarby-Lewis","id":37579938,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NTc5OTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37579938?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis","html_url":"https://github.com/DDarby-Lewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DDarby-Lewis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-31T22:16:39Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T22:23:40Z","body":"I have only had to slightly modify this to get it to work in my case - turns out the only issue is with the \"if srgb format allows usagebits\" - I have a situation where the usage bits on my texture support writing to, which the SRGB doesn't (I think this is the bit that isn't allowed but it could be copy from or some other) but the srgb format is only used in the \"view\" not for the writing or the actual data (i.e. it insctructs the engine to read texture in a speific way) so the actuall underlying data does support the operations.\r\nIt did seem like a reasonable check in the first instance but it isn't applicable in all cases.\r\n\r\nTLDR the check for `RD::get_singleton()->texture_is_format_supported_for_usage(imfmt.rd_format_srgb, tf.usage_bits)` isn't necessary and in my case prevents this from working.\r\n\r\nYou can see my PR for my use of this.\r\n\r\n\r\nEDIT: \r\nStill requires me to add the formats manually to the texture on creation or it hits the error:\r\n\r\n```\r\n  ERROR: Format override is not in the list of allowed shareable formats for original texture.\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141503317/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141701705","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3141701705","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109030","id":3141701705,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67QpBJ","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-01T00:12:42Z","updated_at":"2025-08-01T00:12:42Z","body":"Nice catch. `texture_create_shared` automatically discards unsupported usage bits, so perhaps we only need to check TEXTURE_USAGE_SAMPLING_BIT.\r\n\r\n>Still requires me to add the formats manually to the texture on creation or it hits the error:\r\n  ERROR: Format override is not in the list of allowed shareable formats for original texture.\r\n\r\nI wrongly pushed back the `texture.rd_format_srgb` which hasn't be assigned yet 😅","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3141701705/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3146415034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109030#issuecomment-3146415034","issue_url":"ht